1.BubbleSort

Ręczna symulacja przebiegu algorytmu dla 5 liczb:

Początkowa tablica:
                    1000 -1 1 100 0 -10

Pierwsza pętla:
                    [1000 -1] 1 100 0 -10
                    -1 [1000 1] 100 0 -10
                    -1 1 [1000 100] 0 -10
                    -1 1 100 [1000 0] -10
                    -1 1 100 0 [1000 -10]
                    -1 1 100 0 -10 1000

Druga pętla:
                    [-1 1] 100 0 -10 1000
                    -1 [1 100] 0 -10 1000
                    -1 1 [100 0] -10 1000
                    -1 1 0 [100 -10] 1000
                    -1 1 0 -10 [100 1000]
                    -1 1 0 -10 100 1000

Trzecia pętla:
                     [-1 1] 0 -10 100 1000
                     -1 [1 0] -10 100 1000
                     -1 0 [1 -10] 100 1000
                     -1 0 -10 [1 100] 1000
                     -1 0 -10 1 [100 1000]
                     -1 0 -10 1 100 1000
                 
Czwarta pętla:
                    [-1 0] -10 1 100 1000
                    -1 [0 -10] 1 100 1000
                    -1 -10 [0 1] 100 1000
                    -1 -10 0 [1 100] 1000
                    -1 -10 0 1 [100 1000]
                    -1 -10 0 1 100 1000

Piąta pętla:
                    [-1 -10] 0 1 100 1000
                    -10 [-1 0] 1 100 1000
                    -10 -1 [0 1] 100 1000
                    -10 -1 0 [1 100] 1000
                    -10 -1 0 1 [100 1000]
                    -10 -1 0 1 100 1000

Szósta pętla:
                    [-10 -1] 0 1 100 1000
                    -10 [-1 0] 1 100 1000
                    -10 -1 [0 1] 100 1000
                    -10 -1 0 [1 100] 1000
                    -10 -1 0 1 [100 1000]
                    -10 -1 0 1 100 1000
                    koniec.